      "category": "Arrays, Functions, List, Tuples and Dictionaries",
      "logic": "Bubble sort repeatedly walks the array, swapping any adjacent out-of-order pair. After each full pass the largest unsorted element 'bubbles' to its final position, so n-1 passes fully sort n elements.",
      "code": "# Q3: Sort array elements using bubble sort\nimport array\narr = array.array('i', [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90])\nn = len(arr)\nfor i in range(n - 1):\n    for j in range(n - 1 - i):\n        if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:\n            arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]\nprint(\"Sorted array:\", arr.tolist())",
      "codeHtml": "<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-com\"># Q3: Sort array elements using bubble sort</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">import</span> array</span><span class=\"line\">arr = array.<span class=\"tok-fn\">array</span>(&#x27;i&#x27;, [<span class=\"tok-num\">64</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">34</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">25</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">22</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">11</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">90</span>])</span><span class=\"line\">n = <span class=\"tok-fn\">len</span>(arr)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> i <span class=\"tok-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">range</span>(n - <span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> j <span class=\"tok-kw\">in</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">range</span>(n - <span class=\"tok-num\">1</span> - i):</span><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> arr[j] &gt; arr[j + <span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>]:</span><span class=\"line\">            arr[j], arr[j + <span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>] = arr[j + <span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>], arr[j]</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Sorted array:&quot;, arr.<span class=\"tok-fn\">tolist</span>())</span>",
      "outputLabel": "Output",
