      "code": "# Q5: Generate prime numbers using a function to test prime or not\ndef is_prime(n):\n    if n < 2:\n        return False\n    return all(n % i for i in range(2, int(n ** 0.5) + 1))\n \nlimit = 50\nprimes = [n for n in range(2, limit + 1) if is_prime(n)]\nprint(f\"Prime numbers up to {limit}:\", primes)",
