      "category": "Arrays, Functions, List, Tuples and Dictionaries",
      "logic": "Python function parameters can be supplied by position, by explicit keyword name, with a fallback default value, or gathered arbitrarily via <b>*args</b> (extra positionals) and <b>**kwargs</b> (extra keywords).",
      "code": "# Q8: Positional, keyword, default and variable-length arguments\ndef positional(a, b):\n    print(\"Positional:\", a, b)\n \ndef keyword(name, age):\n    print(\"Keyword:\", name, age)\n \ndef default(name, greeting=\"Hello\"):\n    print(f\"Default: {greeting}, {name}\")\n \ndef variable_length(*args, **kwargs):\n    print(\"Variable *args:\", args)\n    print(\"Variable **kwargs:\", kwargs)\n \npositional(5, 10)\nkeyword(age=21, name=\"Jiya\")\ndefault(\"Mohit\")\nvariable_length(1, 2, 3, city=\"Ahmedabad\", pin=380001)",
      "codeHtml": "<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-com\"># Q8: Positional, keyword, default and variable-length arguments</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">positional</span>(a, b):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Positional:&quot;, a, b)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">keyword</span>(name, age):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Keyword:&quot;, name, age)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">default</span>(name, greeting=&quot;Hello&quot;):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(f&quot;Default: {greeting}, {name}&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">variable_length</span>(*args, **kwargs):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Variable *args:&quot;, args)</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Variable **kwargs:&quot;, kwargs)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">positional</span>(<span class=\"tok-num\">5</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">10</span>)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">keyword</span>(age=<span class=\"tok-num\">21</span>, name=&quot;Jiya&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">default</span>(&quot;Mohit&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">variable_length</span>(<span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">2</span>, <span class=\"tok-num\">3</span>, city=&quot;Ahmedabad&quot;, pin=<span class=\"tok-num\">380001</span>)</span>",
