"tok-fn\">print</span>(f&quot;ID: {s.<span class=\"tok-fn\">get_id</span>()}, Name: {s.<span class=\"tok-fn\">get_name</span>()}, Marks: {s.<span class=\"tok-fn\">get_marks</span>()}&quot;)</span>",
