      "logic": "When multiple base classes define the same method, Python resolves which one runs using the C3 linearisation algorithm, exposed via <b>ClassName.__mro__</b>; here <b>D(B, C)</b> picks <b>B</b>'s <b>greet()</b> first because <b>B</b> precedes <b>C</b> in the MRO.",
      "code": "# Q11: Method Resolution Order (MRO) across several base classes\nclass A:\n    def greet(self): print(\"Hello from A\")\n \nclass B(A):\n    def greet(self): print(\"Hello from B\")\n \nclass C(A):\n    def greet(self): print(\"Hello from C\")\n \nclass D(B, C):\n    pass\n \nD().greet()\nprint(\"MRO:\", [cls.__name__ for cls in D.__mro__])",
      "codeHtml": "<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-com\"># Q11: Method Resolution Order (MRO) across several base classes</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">class</span> A:</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">greet</span>(self): <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Hello <span class=\"tok-kw\">from</span> A&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">B</span>(A):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">greet</span>(self): <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Hello <span class=\"tok-kw\">from</span> B&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">C</span>(A):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-kw\">def</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">greet</span>(self): <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Hello <span class=\"tok-kw\">from</span> C&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">class</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">D</span>(B, C):</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-kw\">pass</span></span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">D</span>().<span class=\"tok-fn\">greet</span>()</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;MRO:&quot;, [cls.__name__ <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> cls <span class=\"tok-kw\">in</span> D.__mro__])</span>",
      "outputLabel": "Output",
      "outputClass": "",
