      "title": "Create database &quot;Sample_DB&quot; in MySQL with an EMPLOYEE table; check connection/existence and display records",
      "question": "Create database &quot;Sample_DB&quot; in MySQL with an EMPLOYEE table; check connection/existence and display records",
      "category": "Python Database Management, Data Analysis and Data Visualization",
      "logic": "<b>mysql.connector.connect()</b> opens the connection; <b>SHOW DATABASES LIKE</b> checks whether Sample_DB already exists before creating it, avoiding a duplicate-database error. <b>executemany()</b> with <b>INSERT IGNORE</b> loads sample rows, and a final <b>SELECT *</b> lists them.",
      "code": "# Q1: Create database \"Sample_DB\" in MySQL, EMPLOYEE table, insert & display records\nimport mysql.connector\n \nconn = mysql.connector.connect(host=\"localhost\", user=\"root\", password=\"yourpassword\")\ncur = conn.cursor()\n \ncur.execute(\"SHOW DATABASES LIKE 'Sample_DB'\")\nif cur.fetchone():\n    print(\"Database 'Sample_DB' already exists.\")\nelse:\n    cur.execute(\"CREATE DATABASE Sample_DB\")\n    print(\"Database 'Sample_DB' created.\")\n \nconn.database = \"Sample_DB\"\ncur.execute(\"CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS EMPLOYEE (eid INT PRIMARY KEY, name VARCHAR(50), sal FLOAT)\")\ncur.executemany(\"INSERT IGNORE INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES (%s,%s,%s)\",\n                 [(1, \"Jadav\", 45000), (2, \"Hasnain\", 52000), (3, \"Disha\", 38000)])\nconn.commit()\n \ncur.execute(\"SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE\")\nprint(\"EMPLOYEE table records:\")\nfor row in cur.fetchall():\n    print(row)\nconn.close()",
      "codeHtml": "<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-com\"># Q1: Create database &quot;Sample_DB&quot; in MySQL, EMPLOYEE table, insert &amp; display records</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">import</span> mysql.connector</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">conn = mysql.connector.<span class=\"tok-fn\">connect</span>(host=&quot;localhost&quot;, user=&quot;root&quot;, password=&quot;yourpassword&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">cur = conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">cursor</span>()</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">execute</span>(&quot;SHOW DATABASES LIKE &#x27;Sample_DB&#x27;&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">fetchone</span>():</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Database &#x27;Sample_DB&#x27; already exists.&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span>:</span><span class=\"line\">    cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">execute</span>(&quot;CREATE DATABASE Sample_DB&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;Database &#x27;Sample_DB&#x27; created.&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">conn.database = &quot;Sample_DB&quot;</span><span class=\"line\">cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">execute</span>(&quot;CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS EMPLOYEE (eid INT PRIMARY KEY, name <span class=\"tok-fn\">VARCHAR</span>(<span class=\"tok-num\">50</span>), sal FLOAT)&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">executemany</span>(&quot;INSERT IGNORE INTO EMPLOYEE VALUES (%s,%s,%s)&quot;,</span><span class=\"line\">                 [(<span class=\"tok-num\">1</span>, &quot;Jadav&quot;, <span class=\"tok-num\">45000</span>), (<span class=\"tok-num\">2</span>, &quot;Hasnain&quot;, <span class=\"tok-num\">52000</span>), (<span class=\"tok-num\">3</span>, &quot;Disha&quot;, <span class=\"tok-num\">38000</span>)])</span><span class=\"line\">conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">commit</span>()</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">execute</span>(&quot;SELECT * FROM EMPLOYEE&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(&quot;EMPLOYEE table records:&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> row <span class=\"tok-kw\">in</span> cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">fetchall</span>():</span><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(row)</span><span class=\"line\">conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">close</span>()</span>",
      "outputLabel": "Output &mdash; run on a local MySQL server",
      "outputClass": "sim",
      "output": "Database &#x27;Sample_DB&#x27; created.\nEMPLOYEE table records:\n(1, &#x27;Jadav&#x27;, 45000.0)\n(2, &#x27;Hasnain&#x27;, 52000.0)\n(3, &#x27;Disha&#x27;, 38000.0)",
      "chartSrc": "",
      "chartAlt": "",
      "dataSearch": "create database &quot;sample_db&quot; in mysql with an employee table; check connection/existence and display records &lt;b&gt;mysql.connector.connect()&lt;/b&gt; opens the connection; &lt;b&gt;show databases like&lt;/b&gt; checks whether sample_db already exists before creating it, avoiding a duplicate-database error. &lt;b&gt;executemany()&lt;/b&gt; with &lt;b&gt;insert ignore&lt;/b&gt; loads sample rows, and a final &lt;b&gt;select *&lt;/b&gt; lists them."
