      "category": "Python Database Management, Data Analysis and Data Visualization",
      "logic": "A parameterised <b>UPDATE ... WHERE eid = %s</b> query safely (SQL-injection-proof) adds the entered hike to the matching employee's salary; <b>cursor.rowcount</b> confirms whether a matching row was actually updated.",
      "code": "# Q2: Increase salary of an employee by accepting eid from the user\nimport mysql.connector\n \nconn = mysql.connector.connect(host=\"localhost\", user=\"root\", password=\"yourpassword\", database=\"Sample_DB\")\ncur = conn.cursor()\n \neid = int(input(\"Enter employee id (eid): \"))\nhike = float(input(\"Enter salary increase amount: \"))\ncur.execute(\"UPDATE EMPLOYEE SET sal = sal + %s WHERE eid = %s\", (hike, eid))\nconn.commit()\nprint(f\"{cur.rowcount} record(s) updated.\" if cur.rowcount else \"No employee found with that eid.\")\nconn.close()",
      "codeHtml": "<span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-com\"># Q2: Increase salary of an employee by accepting eid from the user</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-kw\">import</span> mysql.connector</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">conn = mysql.connector.<span class=\"tok-fn\">connect</span>(host=&quot;localhost&quot;, user=&quot;root&quot;, password=&quot;yourpassword&quot;, database=&quot;Sample_DB&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">cur = conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">cursor</span>()</span><span class=\"line\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"line\">eid = <span class=\"tok-fn\">int</span>(<span class=\"tok-fn\">input</span>(&quot;Enter employee id (eid): &quot;))</span><span class=\"line\">hike = <span class=\"tok-fn\">float</span>(<span class=\"tok-fn\">input</span>(&quot;Enter salary increase amount: &quot;))</span><span class=\"line\">cur.<span class=\"tok-fn\">execute</span>(&quot;UPDATE EMPLOYEE SET sal = sal + %s WHERE eid = %s&quot;, (hike, eid))</span><span class=\"line\">conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">commit</span>()</span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tok-fn\">print</span>(f&quot;{cur.rowcount} <span class=\"tok-fn\">record</span>(s) updated.&quot; <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> cur.rowcount <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> &quot;No employee found <span class=\"tok-kw\">with</span> that eid.&quot;)</span><span class=\"line\">conn.<span class=\"tok-fn\">close</span>()</span>",
      "outputLabel": "Output &mdash; run on a local MySQL server",
